ou waste resources."], [53, 56, "You suffer the loss of a sense for several hours."], [57, 60, "You lose your connection to magic for a day or so, and cannot perform rituals."], [61, 64, "Your ritual affects the target in an unexpected and problematic way."], [65, 68, "Your ritual reveals a surprising and troubling truth."], [69, 72, "You are tempted by dark powers."], [73, 76, "You see a troubling vision of your future."], [77, 80, "You can't perform this ritual again until you acquire an important component."], [81, 84, "You develop a strange fear or compulsion."], [85, 88, "Your ritual causes creatures to exhibit strange or aggressive behavior."], [89, 92, "You are tormented by an apparition from your past."], [93, 96, "You are wracked with sudden sickness."], [97, 100, "Roll twice more on this table. Both results occur. If they are the same result, make it worse."]]}, {"name": "Turning Point Oracles / Major Plot Twist", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 5, "It was all a diversion."], [6, 10, "A dark secret is revealed."], [11, 15, "A trap is sprung."], [16, 20, "An assumption is revealed to be false."], [21, 25, "A secret alliance is revealed."], [26, 30, "Your actions benefit an enemy."], [31, 35, "Someone returns unexpectedly."], [36, 40, "A more dangerous foe is revealed."], [41, 45, "You and an enemy share a common goal."], [46, 50, "A true identity is revealed."], [51, 55, "You are betrayed by someone who was trusted."], [56, 60, "You are too late."], [61, 65, "The true enemy is revealed."], [66, 70, "The enemy gains new allies."], [71, 75, "A new danger appears."], [76, 80, "Someone or something goes missing."], [81, 85, "The truth of a relationship is revealed."], [86, 90, "Two seemingly unrelated situations are shown to be connected."], [91, 95, "Unexpected powers or abilities are revealed."], [96, 100, "Roll twice more on this table. Both results occur. If they are the same result, make it more dramatic."]]}, {"name": "Turning Point Oracles / Challenge Rank", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 20, "Troublesome"], [21, 55, "Dangerous"], [56, 80, "Formidable"], [81, 93, "Extreme"], [94, 100, "Epic"]]}, {"name": "Truths / The Old World", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "The savage clans called the Skulde invaded the kingdoms of the Old World."], [34, 67, "The sickness moved like a horrible wave across the Old World, killing all in its path."], [68, 100, "The Old World could no longer sustain us."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Iron", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "The imposing hills and mountains of the Ironlands are rich in iron ore."], [34, 67, "The weather is bleak."], [68, 100, "Inscrutable metal pillars are found throughout the land."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Legacies", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "We are the first humans to walk these lands."], [34, 67, "Other humans sailed here from the Old World untold years ago, but all that is left of them is a savage, feral people we call the broken."], [68, 100, "Before the Ironlanders, before even the firstborn, another people lived here."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Communities", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "We are few in number in this accursed land."], [34, 67, "We live in communities called circles."], [68, 100, "We have forged the Ironlands into a home."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Leaders", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "Leadership is as varied as the people."], [34, 67, "Each of our communities has its own leader, called an overseer."], [68, 100, "Numerous clan-chiefs rule over petty domains."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Defense", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "Here in the Ironlands, supplies are too precious, and the lands are too sparsely populated, to support organized fighting forces."], [34, 67, "The wardens are our soldiers, guards, and militia."], [68, 100, "Our warbands are rallied to strike at our enemies or defend our holdings."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Mysticism", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "Some still find comfort in the old ways."], [68, 100, "Magic is rare and dangerous, but those few who wield the power are truly gifted."], [68, 100, "Magic courses through this land as the rivers flow through the hills."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Religion", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "A few Ironlanders still make signs or mumble prayers out of habit or tradition, but most believe the gods long ago abandoned us."], [34, 67, "The people honor old gods and new."], [68, 100, "Our gods are many. They make themselves known through manifestations and miracles."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Firstborn", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "The firstborn have passed into legend."], [34, 67, "The firstborn live in isolation and are fiercely protective of their own lands."], [68, 100, "The firstborn hold sway in the Ironlands."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Beasts", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "The beasts of old are nothing but legend."], [34, 67, "Monstrous beasts stalk the wild areas of the Ironlands."], [68, 100, "Beasts of all sorts roam the Ironlands."]]}, {"name": "Truths / Horrors", "dice": "1d100", "rows": [[1, 33, "Nothing but stories to frighten children."], [34, 67, "We are wary of dark forests and deep waterways, for monsters lurk in those places."], [68, 100, "The dead do not rest in the Ironlands."]]}]
